            "subtitle": "An 11-hour Intellipaat AWS beginner course compressed: structure 200+ services into 4 core domains, then complete EC2→S3→RDS→VPC→CI/CD hands-on atop the IAM 'deny-wins' security model and three cost-control rules — Budget alerts, single-region discipline, and terminating resources.",
